Third-party components shipped with the packaged Windows build
===============================================================

The PyInstaller bundle includes these components under their own licences:

* Qt for Python (PySide6), LGPL-3.0-only. The bundle links Qt dynamically, as
  the LGPL requires, and includes the licence texts in
  ``dist\QuantsMind-Agent``.
* ``certifi`` (via httpx), MPL-2.0.
* ``keyring`` (MIT), with ``pywin32`` (PSF-like licence) on Windows.

Qt's LGPL obligations are satisfied by the one-directory PyInstaller layout: a
user can replace the Qt DLLs with their own build.
